7: \r\n48: ---\r\n49: \r\n50: ## 2. Scope of the Canonical Audit\r\n51: \r\n52: The audit covers six core liturgical dimensions across the canonical paradigm matrix catalogued in the workspace authority references:\r\n53: \r\n54: ```\r\n55: ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\n56: │                    Canonical Audit Dimensions & Checkpoints                  │\r\n57: ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n58: │ 1. Vespers Architecture                                                      │\r\n59: │    • Kathisma assignment (Saturday evening Kathisma 1; Weekday Kathisma cycle)│\r\n60: │    • Stichera at \"Lord, I Call\" (Total count 10, 8, 6, 4; exact source ratios)│\r\n61: │    • Doxastikon & Theotokion/Dogmatikon selection (Saturday Tone Dogmatikon) │\r\n62: │    • Litiya & Artoklasia inclusion rules (Rank 5 Polyeleos / Rank 6 Vigil)   │\r\n63: │    • Aposticha hymn distribution & Sunday Theotokion matching                │\r\n64: │    • Dismissal Troparia chain (Resurrectional -> Saint -> Theotokion)        │\r\n65: ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\r\n66: │ 2. Matins Architecture                                                       │\r\n67: │    • Hexapsalmos & opening doxology sequence                                 │\r\n68: │    • \"God is the Lord\" vs. \"Alleluia\" (Simple Lenten / Requiem distinction)  │\r\n69: │    • Kathismata & Sessional Hymns (Kathisma 2/3 + Sessional Hymn w/ Theotokion)│\r\n70: │    • Polyeleos, Megalynarion, & Evlogitaria insertion                        │\r\n71: │    • Hypakoe & Anavathmoi (Gradual hymns of the Tone)                        │\r\n72: │    • Matins Gospel & Eothinon cycle connection (Resurrection Gospel #1-11)   │\r\n73: │    • Canon Ode stacks (Odes 1–9 ratios) & Seasonal Katavasia assignment      │\r\n74: │    • Praises Stichera distribution (Counts of 8, 6, 4 + Glory/Both now)    